            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed m-0">Every Jackery Solar Generator is an Explorer or HomePower unit bundled with SolarSaga panels. Pick the right power station first, then decide whether the bundle's panel wattage matches how you will actually recharge it.</p>
